        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy Bryant, Tony, Richard Beymer, Robbins\n- Works: West Side Story, West Side Story (1961 film)\n- Awards: Academy Awards, Best Picture\n- Roles: singing voice, onscreen actor\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1961 film musical West Side Story, Jimmy Bryant provided the singing voice for Tony.\n- In the 1961 film musical West Side Story, Richard Beymer played Tony onscreen.\n- West Side Story was nominated for 11 Academy Awards.\n- West Side Story won 10 Academy Awards, including Best Picture.\n- West Side Story also received a special Academy Award for Robbins.\n- West Side Story became the record holder for the most Academy Award wins by a movie musical.\n- Jimmy Bryant is best known for providing Tony's singing voice in West Side Story.",
